I can spawn concrete blocks
nearby instead of just under me.

258
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,977
So, um, you want me to throw these?

259
00:14:17,060 --> 00:14:17,960
Hello there.

260
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:19,920
