434
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:25,397
I can tell you.

435
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:27,197
I can tell you?

436
00:22:27,280 --> 00:22:28,297
I can tell you.

437
00:22:28,380 --> 00:22:30,080
Thank you.

438
